{"id":"7a2f1568ce02e54d","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-term-structure.md","title":"Term Structure","display":"df-term-structure — Term Structure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-term-structure","aliases":["57-df-term-structure"],"display":"df-term-structure — Term Structure","depends_on":["[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-term]]","[[57-df-herbrand-universe]]","[[57-df-term-interpretation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-term-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-term-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term-structure — Term Structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d1505219185e27a3\" href=\"?note=d1505219185e27a3\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-universe\">57-df-herbrand-universe</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"701e19aa09901897\" href=\"?note=701e19aa09901897\" title=\"57-df-term-interpretation\">57-df-term-interpretation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Term-Structure-(Term-generated-Structure)\">Term Structure (Term-generated Structure)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>。闭项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HU}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d1505219185e27a3\" href=\"?note=d1505219185e27a3\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-universe\">57-df-herbrand-universe</a>；闭项解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t^{\\mathfrak A}\">\\(t^{\\mathfrak A}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"701e19aa09901897\" href=\"?note=701e19aa09901897\" title=\"57-df-term-interpretation\">57-df-term-interpretation</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term\\text{-}struct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TermStruct}(\\mathfrak A)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in A\\ \\exists t\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ (a=t^{\\mathfrak A}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term\\text{-}struct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TermStruct}(\\mathfrak A)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in A\\ \\exists t\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ (a=t^{\\mathfrak A}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>无赋值的项解释仅对闭项有意义。本谓词表达由语言自身的闭项生成，不把任意赋值下的变量项算作生成元。无常量语言的空闭项集合不会产生非空项结构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Term-Structure-(Term-generated-Structure)","text":"Term Structure (Term-generated Structure)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-herbrand-universe","status":"resolved","id":"d1505219185e27a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-herbrand-universe]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"701e19aa09901897","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-term-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-herbrand-universe","status":"resolved","id":"d1505219185e27a3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$。闭项集合 $\\mathrm{HU}(S)$ 见 [[57-df-herbrand-universe]]；闭项解释 $t^{\\mathfrak A}$ 见 [[57-df-term-interpretation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"701e19aa09901897","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$。闭项集合 $\\mathrm{HU}(S)$ 见 [[57-df-herbrand-universe]]；闭项解释 $t^{\\mathfrak A}$ 见 [[57-df-term-interpretation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HU}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"t^{\\mathfrak A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term\\text{-}struct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TermStruct}(\\mathfrak A)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in A\\ \\exists t\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ (a=t^{\\mathfrak A}).","display":true}],"bytes":979,"backlinks":[{"id":"9b67355a5985a85a","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，$\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\emptyset$；$\\vdash$ 为 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的标准演算。$\\mathrm{Sat}$ 取 [[57-df-satisfiable]]，$\\mathrm{Mod}$ 取 [[57-df-mod]]，$\\mathrm{TermStruct}$ 取 [[57-df-term-structure]]。$\\mathrm{WitnessClosed}$ 由下式定义，要求在同一语言中已备有见证条件，不自动给 $S$ 加常量。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-202","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-a